    dict(key='08-act-3', kind='console', title='Act Three — Search and deletion with equals',
         body='THREE. Search and deletion with equals.\n  search(new Clue("the fountain", 50)) = position 4: 5 comparisons; a record\'s equals compares place and metres\n  the same object? false: equals, not ==, is what matches\n  insertAtPosition(1, the mill (30 m)): 2 pointers changed\n  deleteByKey(new Clue("the red gate", 60)) = true: 4 comparisons, 1 pointer changed',
         narration="Now search. [[slnc 400]] We make a new clue: the fountain, fifty metres. [[slnc 400]] Search compares with equals, and a record's equals compares its fields. [[slnc 300]] So it is found, at position four. [[slnc 400]] But it is a different object: double equals would have missed it. [[slnc 500]] Insertion and deletion change pointers exactly as before."),
